@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Get all events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### 2. Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?category=technology

### 3. Filter by publication status
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?isPublished=true

### 4. Sort and paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?sortBy=eventDate&order=asc&page=2&limit=2

### 5. Get upcoming events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/upcoming

### 6. Get an existing event
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101

### 7. Request a missing event (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/not-real

### 8. Get sessions for an event
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101/sessions

### 9. Get a session under its event
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101/sessions/ses-201

### 10. Request a session that does not belong to the event (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101/sessions/ses-203

### 11. Create a valid event (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Intro to Cloud Computing",
  "description": "A beginner-friendly campus workshop.",
  "location": "Engineering Block, Room 2",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-04T09:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}

### 12. Create an event with missing title (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing title should return 400 Bad Request",
  "location": "Engineering Block, Room 2",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-04T09:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}

### Stretch: Search, dateFrom/dateTo, published-only route
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?search=cloud&dateFrom=2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z&dateTo=2027-02-01T00:00:00.000Z
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/published





@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@apiKey = campus-secret

### 1. GET all events -> 200 OK (also triggers LoggerMiddleware & TimingInterceptor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### 2. Filter by category -> 200 OK with matching category events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?category=technology

### 3. Filter by publication status -> 200 OK with matching isPublished events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?isPublished=true

### 4. Sort and paginate -> 200 OK with sorted items & pagination metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?sortBy=eventDate&order=asc&page=1&limit=2

### 5. Get upcoming events -> 200 OK with events dated today or later
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/upcoming

### 6. Get existing event -> 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101

### 7. Get missing event -> 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/not-real

### 8. Get event sessions -> 200 OK with sessions for evt-101
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101/sessions

### 9. Create valid event -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "title": "Intro to Cloud Computing",
  "description": "A beginner-friendly campus workshop.",
  "location": "Engineering Block, Room 2",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-04T09:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}

### 10. Create invalid event (end/logic or missing/bad fields) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "title": "",
  "location": "Engineering Block, Room 2",
  "eventDate": "not-a-date",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": "not-a-boolean"
}

### 11. Middleware check -> 200 OK & check API console for [Logger] output
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?page=1&limit=5

### 12a. Guard check (missing/invalid key) -> 401 Unauthorized (when CLASSROOM_API_KEY is set & @UseGuards(ApiKeyGuard) is active)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: wrong-key

{
  "title": "Unauthorized Workshop",
  "description": "Should be blocked without valid API key.",
  "location": "Hall A",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-10T10:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}

### 12b. Guard check (valid key) -> 201 Created (when CLASSROOM_API_KEY=campus-secret & @UseGuards(ApiKeyGuard) is active)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "title": "Authorized Workshop",
  "description": "Allowed with valid x-api-key header.",
  "location": "Hall A",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-10T10:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}

### 13. Interceptor check -> 200 OK & check API console for [Timing] start/completed ms log
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101

### 14. ParseIntPipe check (invalid numeric input) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/example?page=hello

### 15. ValidationPipe check (invalid DTO body) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Valid Title Only"
}
